{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter's Job Interview", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Preparation Makes Perfect", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information on instructions about basic activities and safety at work.  ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Disagreeing Politely", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The words \u201cI disagree\u201d  are often too strong. You can use more polite expressions to disagree with someone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To politely disagree with someone, you can say:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'm afraid I disagree. <br />I beg to differ. <br />I'm not so sure about that. <br />Not necessarily. <br />I'm sorry, but I don't agree. <br />Yes, but ...  <br />Actually, ... ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No problem. Can I meet you after the interview? At the coffee shop ... Ned's? <br /> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Actually, we always go there. Let's go to the juice bar. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you agree or disagree you use the<span class=\"strong\"> Present Simple</span> tense.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shoe ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you wear cover your feet ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll wear the grey one and my new pair of shoes too!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use before a job interview.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "suit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set of clothes that includes a jacket and matching pants ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to wear a suit.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "two", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the number after 1 ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Meet me at two o'clock.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "interview ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a meeting about a job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter, do you have a job interview?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "r\u00e9sum\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "information about your education, work and experience ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to bring my updated r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "blue ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "color of the sky   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your blue one is nice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "juice ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a drink made of fruit or vegetables ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's go to the juice bar. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Responding to Good News", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are different ways to respond to good news.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<li> Congratulations! <li> That's great/fantastic/wonderful! <li> What great/fantastic/wonderful news! <li> That's great/fantastic/wonderful news! <li> I'm glad to hear that!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Lisa</span>: I have a new job!<br /> <span class=\"strong\">James:</span> That's fantastic! Congratulations.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Say these words with the long <span class=\"italic\">u</span> sound: <span class=\"italic\">interview</span>, <span class=\"italic\">shoes</span>, <span class=\"italic\">juice</span>, <span class=\"italic\">suit</span>, <span class=\"italic\">blue</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For each word, write 1 sentence about an interview. Example: <span class=\"italic\">I have an interview on Tuesday.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your sentences with a partner. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write complete statements about an interview.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use action words in each statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use words with a long <span class=\"italic\">u</span> sound.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le08ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn2le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      Peter, do you have a job interview?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Yes, tomorrow in the afternoon.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      That's fantastic! Congratulations!", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Thanks, but there are a lot of things to organize.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      Well, you do need to wear a suit. Your navy blue one is nice. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Yes, but it's a bit small. I'll wear the grey one and my new pair of shoes too!", "time": "8000"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     What else do you need to do?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      I need to bring my updated r\u00e9sum\u00e9.\n<br />